# @name jsonplaceholder_patch_post

PATCH https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts/1 HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Patched from Kulala"
}


### JSONPlaceholder: DELETE a fake post

